{"judgments": [
  {"clause_id": "c014",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"All precautions necessary to ensure against the creation, use, or storage of any hazardous material\" is an absolute-sounding standard with no benchmark, and the second sentence limits compliance to \"Environmental Protection Agency laws or regulations\" only. Whether Ohio EPA/ORC obligations or common-law duties fall inside that phrase is open.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.41},
     {"issue": "This narrow undertaking to comply with \"Environmental Protection Agency laws or regulations\" sits against paragraph 7.F, which requires conformity with all applicable federal, state and local laws, leaving Hardrives' environmental compliance duty stated at two different widths. A court would have to decide which measure governs contamination claims.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.33}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c015",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "The indemnity covers claims \"resulting from injury on or about the Premises or in conjunction with Hardrives' use and occupancy,\" without saying whether \"injury\" reaches environmental contamination and cleanup costs or only bodily/property injury, and without any carve-out for the City's own fault. Both the subject matter and the party protected are open to construction.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.47},
     {"issue": "A broad indemnity running to the City is difficult to square with paragraph 6.D, in which the City warrants the environmental condition of the Premises, if the same contamination is both warranted against and indemnified. A court could be asked which provision allocates pre-existing contamination liability.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.36}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c016",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": null, "type": 1, "prob": 0.13},
     {"issue": "The general compliance covenant overlaps paragraph 7.D's narrower Environmental Protection Agency compliance obligation, and it is unclear whether the specific environmental clause qualifies this general one. The tension is mild but nameable.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.22}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c017",
